Package: scGSVA
Type: Package
Title: GSVA and UCell signature enrichment analysis for single cell RNA seq
Version: 0.0.27
Authors@R: c(person("Kai","Guo",email = "guokai8@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")
          ),
          person("Zhihan","Wang",role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Kai Guo <guokai8@gmail.com>
Description: Provides wrapper functions to perform GSVA, ssGSEA, PLAGE,
    z-score and UCell enrichment analysis for single-cell RNA-seq data.
    Includes a custom C++ optimized implementation of all four GSVA scoring
    methods that produces identical results to the original GSVA Bioconductor
    package but runs significantly faster (up to 200x). Also includes
    functions to build gene set annotations for multiple species (KEGG, GO,
    Reactome, MSigDB) and generate publication-ready visualizations including
    violin plots, dot plots, ridge plots, heatmaps, and spatial plots.
